This repository also redistributes the Inter typeface, under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1, in two places: the source .ttf files in packages/scripts/textgen/fonts,
and the MSDF and polygon atlases the example app draws with in
packages/example-app/public/fonts. The engine package itself carries no typeface.
